# TradingVault — Cursor Auto-Start Rules
# This file is read automatically by Cursor every time you open this project.
# Claude Code follows these rules without being asked.

## On Project Open — Do This Automatically

1. Read CLAUDE.md completely
2. Read rules/rules.md
3. Read logs/decisions-log.md (last 5 entries)
4. Read references/AI-Trader/README.md
5. Read references/Kronos/README.md
6. Read references/notebooklm-py/README.md
7. Read references/llmwiki/README.md
8. Confirm: "Vault loaded. Ready to build."

## Always Active Rules

- Never suggest a trade without ATR(7) stop loss
- Never skip weekly (1W) bias before 4H analysis
- Always log signals to logs/decisions-log.md
- Always save Morning Brief to sources/YYYY-MM-DD-morning-brief.md
- Never override rules/rules.md under any circumstances
- When writing new agent code, save to agent/ directory
- After every new script, run it and confirm it works before moving on

